+          // The marker belongs to the full-row list, and anchoring it to the
+          // last child regardless drew a capsule-wide line under an icon
+          // whenever there were favorites but no pinned rows below them.
+          !IsDropIndicatorCandidate(*child_layout.child_view)) {
